data: {"type": "action", "id": "act2", "icon": "web", "title": "Read web page", "results": [{"icon": "", "title": "Page"}], "results_units": "Pages", "ended_at": "2026-08-01T09:00:23.479070Z", "output": "{\"source\": \"firecrawl\", \"url\": \"https://hightouch.com\", \"title\": \"Hightouch | Customer Data & AI Platform for Marketers (CDP & AI Agents)\", \"description\": \"Hightouch is the Agentic Marketing Platform powered by the industry-leading Composable CDP: AI marketing that actually knows your brand, customers, and business.\", \"content\": \"[Skip to main content](https://hightouch.com/#main-content)\\n\\n[In 2021, Hightouch redefined what a CDP is. It's time to do it again \\u2192](https://hightouch.com/blog/the-agentic-cdp)\\n\\n[Hightouch.](https://hightouch.com/)\\n\\nCopy .SVG [Brand assets](https://cdn.sanity.io/files/pwmfmi47/production/dfa3f0ab1eb96cb80f0b659f5c06241a842c5ec2.zip) [Press](https://hightouch.com/press)\\n\\n- Platform\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n[Agentic Marketing Platform](https://hightouch.com/platform/agentic-marketing-platform)\\n\\n[Ad StudioNew\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nCreate and launch winning ads at scale, all backed by data](https://hightouch.com/platform/ad-studio) [Content Assembly\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nCreate infinite content using your existing assets and brand guidelines](https://hightouch.com/platform/content-assembly) [AI Decisioning\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nDeliver 1:1 experiences at scale using reinforcement learning](https://hightouch.com/platform/ai-decisioning)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n[Composable CDP](https://hightouch.com/platform/composable-cdp)\\n\\n[Customer Studio\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nBuild audiences](https://hightouch.com/platform/customer-studio) [Reverse ETL\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nSync data](https://hightouch.com/platform/reverse-etl) [Identity Resolution\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nStitch users together](https://hightouch.com/platform/identity-resolution) [Hightouch Events\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nCollect data](https://hightouch.com/platform/events) [Real-time Personalization\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nDynamic digital experiences](https://hightouch.com/platform/real-time-personalization) [Match Booster\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nIncrease ad match rates](https://hightouch.com/platform/match-booster) [Intelligence\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nAnalyze campaigns](https://hightouch.com/platform/intelligence)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nEnterprise-ready platform features\\n\\n\\n\\n[Enterprise-level security\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nEnterprise-level security with SOC 2 Type 2 and ISO 27001 certification](https://hightouch.com/platform/security) [Observability\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nFull transparency and control to monitor and troubleshoot](https://hightouch.com/platform/observability) [Governance & access control\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nRobust access control and change management](https://hightouch.com/docs/workspace-management/overview)\\n\\n- Solutions\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nBy team\\n\\n\\n\\n[Marketing](https://hightouch.com/solutions/marketing) [Advertising](https://hightouch.com/solutions/advertising) [Data](https://hightouch.com/solutions/data) [Operations](https://hightouch.com/solutions/operations)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nBy industry\\n\\n\\n\\n[Retail & eCommerce](https://hightouch.com/solutions/retail) [Financial Services](https://hightouch.com/solutions/financial-services) [Travel & Hospitality](https://hightouch.com/solutions/travel) [Media & Entertainment](https://hightouch.com/solutions/media) [Quick Service Restaurants](https://hightouch.com/solutions/qsr) [Healthcare](https://hightouch.com/solutions/healthcare) [B2B SaaS](https://hightouch.com/solutions/saas)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nFor marketing\\n\\n\\n\\n[Audience segmentation](https://hightouch.com/platform/customer-studio) [Journey orchestration](https://hightouch.com/platform/customer-studio#journeys) [Real-time personalization](https://hightouch.com/platform/real-time-personalization) [Profile enrichment](https://hightouch.com/platform/customer-studio#traits) [Customer 360](https://hightouch.com/platform/identity-resolution)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nFor advertising\\n\\n\\n\\n[Audience targeting](https://hightouch.com/playbooks/improve-conversions-with-personalized-funnel-based-ad-retargeting) [Audience suppression](https://hightouch.com/playbooks/Suppress-Existing-Customers-from-Facebook-Campaigns) [Conversion tracking](https://hightouch.com/playbooks/send-better-signals-with-facebook-conversion-api) [Match rate boosting](https://hightouch.com/platform/match-booster)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nFeatured\\n\\n[![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F37110b9452fff8098d4a8e4c67b5b8e9889f7e6a-2400x1254.jpg%3Fw%3D500&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nLearn about the benefits of a Composable CDP and how it compares to a traditional CDP solution\\\\\\\\\\nLearn more](https://hightouch.com/resources/traditional-cdp-vs-composable-cdp)\\n\\n- Integrations\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nAll integrations\\n\\n\\n\\n[Integration catalog\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nHightouch integrates with 300+ tools spanning Advertising, Marketing Automation, CRMs, Customer Success, and more](https://hightouch.com/integrations) [See all 300+ integrations](https://hightouch.com/integrations)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nPopular sources\\n\\n\\n\\n[Snowflake](https://hightouch.com/solutions/snowflake-cdp) [Databricks](https://hightouch.com/solutions/databricks-cdp) [Google BigQuery](https://hightouch.com/solutions/google-bigquery-cdp) [AWS Redshift](https://hightouch.com/solutions/aws-redshift-cdp) [Azure Synapse](https://hightouch.com/solutions/azure-synapse-cdp) [See all sources](https://hightouch.com/integrations?type=source)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nPopular destinations\\n\\n\\n\\n[Salesforce](https://hightouch.com/integrations/destinations/salesforce) [HubSpot](https://hightouch.com/integrations/destinations/hubspot) [Google Ads](https://hightouch.com/integrations/destinations/google) [Facebook Ads](https://hightouch.com/integrations/destinations/facebook) [The Trade Desk](https://hightouch.com/solutions/the-trade-desk) [See all destinations](https://hightouch.com/integrations?type=destination)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nPopular extensions\\n\\n\\n\\n[dbt](https://hightouch.com/solutions/dbt) [Sigma](https://hightouch.com/solutions/sigma) [Looker](https://hightouch.com/docs/extensions/looker-models) [Fivetran](https://hightouch.com/solutions/fivetran)\\n\\n- [Customers](https://hightouch.com/customers)\\n- Resources\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nExplore\\n\\n\\n\\n[Blog](https://hightouch.com/blog/category/all/page/1) [Learn](https://hightouch.com/learn) [Whitepapers & guides](https://hightouch.com/resources) [Playbooks](https://hightouch.com/playbooks) [Lifecycle Leaders newsletter](https://lifecycle-leaders.hightouch.com/) [CDP Comparisons](https://hightouch.com/compare-cdps)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nDocumentation\\n\\n\\n\\n[Core concepts\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nUnderstand the basics of how Hightouch works](https://hightouch.com/docs/getting-started/concepts) [Syncs\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nSyncs define how you want to get data from your source to destination](https://hightouch.com/docs/syncs/overview) [Models\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nHightouch models define and organize data from a source](https://hightouch.com/docs/models/creating-models) [Read our docs](https://hightouch.com/docs)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nGet started\\n\\n\\n\\n[Talk to us\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nSchedule 30-minutes to talk through how to solve your use cases](https://hightouch.com/demo) [Events\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nFind conferences, local events, and webinars to learn more](https://hightouch.com/events) [Solutions partners\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nOur Partners design, build and deliver exceptional data solutions](https://hightouch.com/solutions-partners)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nFeatured\\n\\n[![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Ffaf4a29db38f4d84cf1ea65f546b6e55ee9c24ee-1056x960.png%3Fw%3D500&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nSee why Hightouch was named a CDP Leader by Gartner\\u00ae\\\\\\\\\\nGet the report](https://hightouch.com/gartner)\\n\\n- [Pricing](https://hightouch.com/pricing)\\n\\n[Log in](https://app.hightouch.com/login) [Get a demo](https://hightouch.com/demo?ref=/)\\n\\n# Marketing looks different here\\n\\n## Go from insight to live campaign in minutes \\u2013 powered by all your data, brand knowledge, and AI.\\n\\nGet a demo\\n\\n# Marketing looks different here\\n\\n## Go from insight to live campaign in minutes \\u2013 powered by all your data, brand knowledge, and AI.\\n\\nGet a demo\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhero-bg-morning.7e21953e.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhero-bg-day.8557be1e.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhero-bg-night.f05a67c3.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\nUse left and right arrow keys to navigate slides. Press space to pause or resume automatic slide advancement.\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fbeauty-ad-card.d832edc9.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ffintech-ad-card.d5c05984.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ftravel-ad-card.944b7ce1.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fluggage-ad-card.60a53264.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flifestyle-ad-card.820e95bc.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\nContext loading\\n\\nThe world\\u2019s most innovative companies choose Hightouch\\n\\n[![Spotify.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F52239a76bc8ed292a68bda99d185c5e1170f867e-801x220.svg%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Warner Music Group.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F84dbb616e064de970801b02e16e419d60fcd4b44-2560x1009.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![PetSmart.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Fe70a07028cd578556c2b58facdc711280c65fa9d-1000x256.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Grammarly.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Fa259fa88813a05bbab4382e9d00d56b3bd619195-600x130.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Dominos.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F8f11d589caa305eb61f3fe2511fa75ca40acf82e-667x148.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Autotrader.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F7101dff53d748438d7b85052a896483a362b5d97-1170x138.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Doordash.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F70bcb0fa3278b8fae686124a1373d1a842c2c03d-2500x292.svg%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Salomon.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Ff422d765094df480d20ad6505453122c24600cfc-3840x439.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)](https://hightouch.com/customers) [![Spotify.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F52239a76bc8ed292a68bda99d185c5e1170f867e-801x220.svg%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Doordash.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F70bcb0fa3278b8fae686124a1373d1a842c2c03d-2500x292.svg%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Aritzia.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Fffef00131ab19307fec4fa82af64da21a9eaf77b-2138x422.svg%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Dominos.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F8f11d589caa305eb61f3fe2511fa75ca40acf82e-667x148.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Warner Music Group.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F84dbb616e064de970801b02e16e419d60fcd4b44-2560x1009.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![PetSmart.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Fe70a07028cd578556c2b58facdc711280c65fa9d-1000x256.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![WHOOP.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F5a41afd1824550ede6ff680a481ecfb022ef7a2f-205x35.svg%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Chime.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Fc08b0fdac961455e9d6d6e222d80231fc43c7ef6-672x193.svg%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Salomon.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Ff422d765094df480d20ad6505453122c24600cfc-3840x439.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Iterable.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F6d16dd4cdf4556b1fc8e62cb10316e03863924f1-3127x862.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Nando's.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F7e562bef22a4df2fa16bbf96cc831fbd7c63492e-218x72.svg%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Headway.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F2100de02270f34575ca096f1d704cde80fda1e44-1836x360.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Ramp.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Facaf90882a1ded8a3796cc3972219355a42d009c-270x72.svg%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Grammarly.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Fa259fa88813a05bbab4382e9d00d56b3bd619195-600x130.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![DraftKings.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F496f4082c60cdffe237335a3cddefb4af2db69af-539x280.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Autotrader.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F7101dff53d748438d7b85052a896483a362b5d97-1170x138.png%3Fw%3D300&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nRead case studies](https://hightouch.com/customers)\\n\\n## Reinvent the way your marketing team works\\n\\n[Agentic Marketing Platform (AMP) **Never run out of on-brand ads or emails again** \\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nThe fastest way to launch insight-backed campaigns across performance and lifecycle marketing.\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nDiscover AMP\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Hightouch Ad Studio editing a 'Spring Campaign' luggage ad headlined 'One is simply not enough \\u2014 Meet the new collection,' with a sidebar of size variant thumbnails.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Famp-ui.68ee13fb.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)](https://hightouch.com/platform/agentic-marketing-platform) [Composable Customer Data Platform (CDP) **Activate your complete customer data in real time** \\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nAccess real-time marketing data and insights with the most flexible, secure, and quick-to-deploy CDP.\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nLearn about Composable CDP\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n![Hightouch Audience builder named 'USA Active Customers' with filters for country equals USA and a product viewed within the past 7 days at price $50 or more, beside a 'High LTV Email Abandoners' Venn diagram of audience overlap.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcdp-ui.6eade51e.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)](https://hightouch.com/platform/composable-cdp)\\n\\n## Turn unseen opportunities into perfectly executed campaigns\\n\\nConnect AI that\\u2019s trained on all your brand context and data to every customer-facing channel.\\n\\n### Complete enterprise context\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-1-bg.bba8a8d2.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch brand kit, asset library of pastel suitcases, and customer context graph linking data sources to targeting and campaign nodes.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-1.a1826d25.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n### Proactive agentic insights\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-2-bg.d8f21b42.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch trends panel flagging group vacations and nostalgic imagery beside a line chart, with an AI-drafted creative brief covering concept and audience.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-2.fbabf81c.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n### On-brand creative, every time\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-3-bg.34d7ec07.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![On-brand suitcase ad variants rendered across email, SMS, and video channels with matching 'Travel light' creative and 20% off copy.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-3.da1c8424.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n### Real-time, omnichannel orchestration\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-4-bg.1ed78eee.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch journey builder flow branching from Start through an A/B split into offer test and holdout paths, ending in upsell email and re-marketing audience steps.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-4.0a30d10b.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-1-bg.bba8a8d2.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch brand kit, asset library of pastel suitcases, and customer context graph linking data sources to targeting and campaign nodes.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-1.a1826d25.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n### Complete enterprise context\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-2-bg.d8f21b42.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch trends panel flagging group vacations and nostalgic imagery beside a line chart, with an AI-drafted creative brief covering concept and audience.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-2.fbabf81c.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n### Proactive agentic insights\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-3-bg.34d7ec07.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![On-brand suitcase ad variants rendered across email, SMS, and video channels with matching 'Travel light' creative and 20% off copy.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-3.da1c8424.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n### On-brand creative, every time\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-4-bg.1ed78eee.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch journey builder flow branching from Start through an A/B split into offer test and holdout paths, ending in upsell email and re-marketing audience steps.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fcard-4.0a30d10b.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n### Real-time, omnichannel orchestration\\n\\n## Plan, create, and execute your marketing faster and more autonomously\\n\\nFrom insight and audience, to creative and execution, marketers get specialized support at every step.\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fday.8557be1e.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch Intelligence displaying a graph regarding how much revenue a user earned from campaigns within the last year.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Finsights.57eff9dc.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch Intelligence displaying a graph regarding how much revenue a user earned from campaigns within the last year.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Finsights-mobile.a94be3e9.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fnight.f05a67c3.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch Audience builder named 'USA Active Customers' with filters selecting users with their country equal to 'USA' and had viewed a product greater than $50 within 7 days.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Faudience-builder.086198e4.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch Audience builder named 'USA Active Customers' with filters selecting users with their country equal to 'USA' and had viewed a product greater than $50 within 7 days.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Faudience-builder-mobile.9d49def3.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fday.8557be1e.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch UI showing a 'Spring Sale, Active Trail Enthusiasts' email (Version 3) with a '20% Off Trail Essentials' Great Outdoors creative, alongside agent recommendations and a 'Highest-AOV buyers open late' chart.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fad-insights.e70d3c02.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch UI showing a 'Spring Sale, Active Trail Enthusiasts' email (Version 3) with a '20% Off Trail Essentials' Great Outdoors creative, alongside agent recommendations and a 'Highest-AOV buyers open late' chart.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fad-insights-mobile.52d80a1e.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fmorning.7e21953e.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch Ad Studio UI editing a 'Spring Campaign' luggage ad with the headline 'One is simply not enough \\u2014 Meet the new collection,' a sidebar of size variant thumbnails, and a brief panel detailing message and hook strategy.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fad-studio.d534f508.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Hightouch Ad Studio UI editing a 'Spring Campaign' luggage ad with the headline 'One is simply not enough \\u2014 Meet the new collection,' a sidebar of size variant thumbnails, and a brief panel detailing message and hook strategy.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fad-studio-mobile.7c0f6935.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n### Explore insights\\n\\nBrainstorm winning campaigns faster. Use agents to aggregate signals across your data, market, and competitors to surface what to act on next.\\n\\n### Build audiences & journeys\\n\\nCreate any audience with a no-code builder, then orchestrate personalized journeys across every channel in your stack.\\n\\n### Generate lifecycle campaigns\\n\\nGo from idea to personalized campaign in minutes. Agents help plan, create, and execute across channels by pulling from existing assets and customer data.\\n\\n### Create on-brand ads at scale\\n\\nBuild, edit, and launch on-brand ads at the volume performance marketing requires. Agents create infinite ads from approved assets and informed by data.\\n\\n### Explore insights\\n\\nBrainstorm winning campaigns faster. Use agents to aggregate signals across your data, market, and competitors to surface what to act on next.\\n\\n## Hightouch named a Leader in Gartner\\u00ae Magic Quadrant\\u2122 for Customer Data Platforms\\n\\nGet the report\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fgartner-bg.ebb5c655.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Gartner Magic Quadrant for Customer Data Platforms, January 2026, showing Hightouch positioned in the Leaders quadrant alongside other platforms.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fgartner-quadrant.611338b0.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n## Leaders are reinventing marketing with data and AI. You can too.\\n\\n![Fundrise logo.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Fd0f65629083ac62108cb3723b665cb88549338bc-539x106.png&w=384&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n### Fundrise scales 1:1 personalization with AI agents to drive investment growth\\n\\n[Read story](https://hightouch.com/customers/fundrise)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F6dac22c832e6592a3b14cc0b0f0dec81f8a0eff6-1320x743.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![Warner Music Group logo.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2F84dbb616e064de970801b02e16e419d60fcd4b44-2560x1009.png&w=384&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n### Warner Music Group leverages Hightouch to \\u201csuper-serve\\u201d fans, artists, and labels\\n\\n[Read story](https://hightouch.com/customers/wmg)\\n\\n![PetSmart logo.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fpwmfmi47%2Fproduction%2Fe70a07028cd578556c2b58facdc711280c65fa9d-1000x256.png&w=384&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n### PetSmart personalizes journeys for over 70 million loyalty program members\\n\\n[Read story](https://hightouch.com/customers/petsmart)\\n\\n![