to your data warehouse, putting you in complete control of data governance and data storage.\\n\\n![ISO 27001 Certification.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fiso-badge.cd02ebd6.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n![](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Findustry-leader-bg.90fe593f.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\n\\n## Recognized as an industry leader\\n\\n[![Snowflake logo.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fsnowflake.571992aa.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\n2026 Marketers & Advertisers\\\\\\\\\\nProduct Partner of the Year](https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260602248845/en/Hightouch-Named-2026-Marketers-and-Advertisers-Snowflake-Product-Partner-of-the-Year)\\n\\n[![G2 Award: Best Estimated ROI, Summer 2025.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fg2-best-est-roi.ae1107fd.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nBest Estimated\\\\\\\\\\nROI](https://www.g2.com/products/hightouch/reviews)\\n\\n[![Iterable logo.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fiterable.c1eaecf6.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nTechnology Partner\\\\\\\\\\nof the Year](https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/iterable-names-hightouch-as-technology-partner-of-the-year-and-announces-smart-ingest-302133519.html?tc=eml_cleartime)\\n\\n[![Redpoint logo.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fredpoint.868b7c3d.png&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\nNamed to Redpoint Ventures\\u2019\\\\\\\\\\n2026 InfraRed 100](https://www.redpoint.com/infrared/report/)\\n\\n[![Forbes 2026: America's best startup employers, powered by statista.](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fforbes.b1523c71.png&w=3840&q=