stinations/zoomd)\\n\\n## Get a personalized demo\\n\\nMeet with an implementation expert to learn how Hightouch can help you achieve your top business priorities.\\n\\nGet a demo\\n\\nPlatform\\n\\n[Composable CDP](https://hightouch.com/platform/composable-cdp) [Agentic Marketing Platform](https://hightouch.com/platform/agentic-marketing-platform) [Ad Studio](https://hightouch.com/platform/ad-studio) [Content Assembly](https://hightouch.com/platform/content-assembly) [AI Decisioning](https://hightouch.com/platform/ai-decisioning) [Reverse ETL](https://hightouch.com/platform/reverse-etl) [Customer Studio](https://hightouch.com/platform/customer-studio) [Identity Resolution](https://hightouch.com/platform/identity-resolution) [Hightouch Events](https://hightouch.com/platform/events) [Real-time Personalization](https://hightouch.com/platform/real-time-personalization) [Match Booster](https://hightouch.com/platform/match-booster) [Intelligence](https://hightouch.com/platform/intelligence) [Observability](https://hightouch.com/platform/observability) [Extensions](https://hightouch.com/platform/extensions) [Security](https://hightouch.com/platform/security)\\n\\nSolutions\\n\\nBy team\\n\\n[Marketing](https://hightouch.com/solutions/marketing) [Advertising](https://hightouch.com/solutions/advertising) [Data](https://hightouch.com/solutions/data) [Operations](https://hightouch.com/solutions/operations)\\n\\nBy industry\\n\\n[Retail & eCommerce](https://hightouch.com/solutions/retail) [Financial Services](https://hightouch.com/solutions/financial-services) [Travel & Hospitality](https://hightouch.com/solutions/travel) [Media & Entertainment](https://hightouch.com/solutions/media) [Quick Service Restaurants](https://hightouch.com/solutions/qsr) [Healthcare](https://hightouch.com/solutions/healthcare) [B2B SaaS](https://hightouch.com/solutions/saas)\\n\\nResources\\n\\n[Docs](https://hightouch.com/docs) [Changelog](https://changelog.hightouch.io/) [Integrations](https://hightouch.com/integrations) [Blog](https://hightouch.com/blog/category/all/page/1) [Playbooks](https://hightouch.com/playbooks) [Whitepapers & guides](https://hightouch.com/resources) [Compare CDPs](https://hightouch.com/compare-cdps) [CDP Industries Hub](https://hightouch.com/cdp-industries) [Composable CDP Hub](https://hightouch.com/solutions/composable-cdp) [SQL Dictionary](https://hightouch.com/sql-dictionary)\\n\\nCompany\\n\\n[Careers](https://hightouch.com/careers) [About us](https://hightouch.com/about) [Customers](https://hightouch.com/customers) [Pricing](https://hightouch.com/pricing) [Press](https://hightouch.com/press) [Events](https://hightouch.com/events) [Solutions partners](https://hightouch.com/solutions-partners)\\n\\nSocial\\n\\n[LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/company/hightouchio/) [Twitter](https://x.com/HightouchData) [Youtube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmjKHswj5UPdKqkrHB8RhVw)\\n\\nLegal & Privacy\\n\\n[Privacy Policy](https://hightouch.com/privacy-policy) [Cookie Policy](https://hightouch.com/cookie-policy) [Terms of Service](https://hightouch.com/terms-of-service) [Platform Privacy Notice](https://hightouch.com/platform-privacy)Cookie preferences [Your privacy choices\\\\\\\\\\n![California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) Opt-Out Icon](https://hightouch.com/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fprivacy-choices.783b3784.svg&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_4bmdtR7QWLJFHoELLaZ1BqiZTszL)](https://preferences.hightouch.com/)\\n\\n[All systems normal](https://status.hightouch.io/)\\nEnglish\\n\\n[English](https://hightouch.com/) [Fran\\u00e7ais](https://hightouch.com/fr) [Espa\\u00f1ol](https://hightouch.com/es)\\n\\nHightouch \\u00a9 2026\\n\\nGartner, Magic Quadrant for Customer Data Platforms, Lizzy Foo Kune, Rachel Dooley, Suzanne White, Benjamin Bloom, Audrey Brosnan, 26 January 2026\\n\\nGARTNER is a registered trademark and service mark of Gartner, Inc. and/or its affiliates in the U.S. and internationally and is used herein with permission. All rights reserved.\\n\\nMagic Quadrant is a registered trademark of Gartner, Inc. and/or its affiliates and is used herein with permission. All rights reserved.\\n\\nGartner does not endorse any vendor, product or service depicted in its research publications, and does not advise technology users to select only those vendors with the highest ratings or other designation. Gartner research publications consist of the opinions of Gartner's research organization and should not be construed as statements of fact. Gartner disclaims all warranties, expressed or implied, with respect to this research, including any warranties of merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose.\\n\\nChili Deanonymization Iframe\\n\\nChili Piper - Loader\\n\\nChili chat\"}", "has_succeeded": true, "artifacts": []}

