data: {"type": "assistant", "id": "a5", "content": "Here's a summary of what changed and why:\n\n**Structure added:**\n- **Executive Summary** up front, so any reader (including senior team members) gets the key takeaways without reading everything\n- **Comparison table** across all five competitors, making it easy to spot patterns at a glance\n- **Consolidated recommendations section** at the end, so the document ends with clear action items rather than trailing off\n\n**Writing sharpened throughout:**\n- Removed repetitive phrasing and passive constructions\n- Split observations (\"what they do well\") from lessons (\"what DOJO should do\"), which were blended together in the original\n- Added a \"Where They Are Weaker\" sub-section for competitors where it was relevant\n\n**Hightouch significantly expanded:**\n- Pulled their live website (June 2026): they have made a **major positioning pivot**. Their old headline was \"The Composable CDP and AI Decisioning Platform.\" Their new headline is \"Marketing looks different here.\" They are now explicitly positioning as an Agentic Marketing Platform with brand-aware AI. This is DOJO's territory.\n- Documented their full product structure (two pillars: AMP + Composable CDP)\n- Added their customer proof points (Spotify, Warner Music Group, PetSmart, Domino's), awards (Gartner Leader, Snowflake Partner of the Year), and specific case study metrics\n- Added a \"Where They Are Weaker\" section with concrete gaps DOJO can exploit\n\n**US vs. EU section:** tightened the writing and added the practical three-layer page structure recommendation (5 seconds to understand, 5 minutes to believe).\n\nWant me to adjust the tone, add anything, or convert this into a presentation format?"}

