data: {"type": "action", "id": "act13", "icon": "notebook", "title": "Coding", "results": [], "results_units": "Results", "started_at": "2026-08-01T09:13:18.942378Z", "ended_at": "2026-08-01T09:13:54.076021Z", "input": {"source": "\n# --- Hightouch ---\nadd_heading2(doc, \"3. Hightouch\")\nthreat_label(doc, \"High (Priority Competitor)\", (0xC0, 0x30, 0x30))\nadd_table_2col(doc, [\n    (\"Headline\", '\"Marketing looks different here.\"'),\n    (\"Subheadline\", '\"Go from insight to live campaign in minutes – powered by all your data, brand knowledge, and AI.\"'),\n    (\"Headline Style\", \"Bold, execution-focused, outcome-led\"),\n    (\"Primary CTA\", \"Get a Demo\"),\n    (\"Secondary CTA\", \"(none prominent)\"),\n])\n\nadd_note_box(doc, \"Hightouch has undergone a major positioning pivot since early 2026. Their previous headline was 'The Composable CDP and AI Decisioning Platform' — a technical, data-first identity. Their current headline abandons that almost entirely. They are now positioning as an Agentic Marketing Platform. This is a direct move into DOJO's territory.\")\n\nadd_heading3(doc, \"Core Value Proposition\")\nadd_body(doc, \"Hightouch now positions itself as AI marketing that 'actually knows your brand, customers, and business.' This is a meaningful shift: they are no longer just a data activation layer. They are claiming brand-aware AI execution, fast campaign creation, and agentic marketing intelligence — all claims that directly compete with DOJO's core positioning.\")\n\nadd_heading3(doc, \"Messaging Themes\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"Primary: Marketing execution speed ('from insight to live campaign in minutes')\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"Secondary: Brand-aware AI\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"Supporting: Complete enterprise context, proactive agentic insights, on-brand creative, omnichannel orchestration\")\n\nadd_heading3(doc, \"Full Platform Breakdown (as of June 2026)\")\nadd_body(doc, \"Hightouch now operates two distinct platform pillars, both prominently featured on the homepage:\")\n\nadd_heading3(doc, \"Agentic Marketing Platform (AMP) — the new product\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Ad Studio:** AI-powered ad creation and launch at scale\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Content Assembly:** Infinite on-brand content generation from existing assets\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**AI Decisioning:** 1:1 personalisation at scale using reinforcement learning\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Intelligence:** Campaign analysis and agentic insights\")\n\nadd_heading3(doc, \"Composable CDP — the foundation\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Customer Studio:** Audience building and journey orchestration\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Reverse ETL:** Data syncing from warehouse to tools\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Identity Resolution:** User stitching across sources\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Real-time Personalisation:** Dynamic digital experiences\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Match Booster:** Improved ad match rates\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Hightouch Events:** First-party data collection\")\n\nadd_body(doc, \"Hightouch connects to 300+ tools, holds Gartner Magic Quadrant Leader status (CDP, January 2026), and counts Spotify, Warner Music Group, PetSmart, Grammarly, DoorDash, and Domino's as customers.\")\n\nadd_heading3(doc, \"What They Do Well\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**The pivot itself is strategically significant.** Moving from 'Composable CDP' (understood mainly by data teams) to 'Agentic Marketing Platform' (understood by marketers) dramatically widens their addressable audience.\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Strong social proof architecture.** Household-name logos (Spotify, Domino's, Warner Music Group) appear immediately below the hero section, creating instant credibility. Multiple awards (Gartner Leader, Snowflake Partner of the Year, G2 Momentum Leader) are displayed in a dedicated section.\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Specificity in outcomes.** Rather than vague claims, Hightouch uses concrete proof points: 'Otrium cuts campaign launch time by 70% and drives 15% more conversions.'\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**The four-pillar execution narrative.** Their 'Plan, create, and execute' section breaks the workflow into four stages (Explore insights, Build audiences, Generate campaigns, Create ads), making the platform feel comprehensive without being overwhelming.\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Security and governance front-loaded.** Their enterprise-grade security section appears mid-page, signalling that compliance is part of the product — not a footnote.\")\n\nadd_heading3(doc, \"Where They Are Weaker\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**The new headline is bold but vague.** 'Marketing looks different here' says nothing about how or why. A first-time visitor may not immediately understand what the product does or who it is for.\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**The dual-product structure creates complexity.** Having both an Agentic Marketing Platform and a Composable CDP as co-equal pillars forces visitors to do cognitive work to understand which product they need.\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**Serving two audiences simultaneously dilutes the message.** Navigation sections 'By team' (Marketing, Advertising, Data, Operations) reflect a breadth that weakens the marketing-specific pitch. DOJO speaks directly and exclusively to marketing leaders.\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"**No category ownership.** 'Agentic Marketing Platform' is a description, not a category. DOJO's claim as 'the intelligent marketing system' is a stronger category-creation play.\")\n\nadd_heading3(doc, \"Key Lessons for DOJO\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"Hightouch is now a direct competitor in messaging, not just in product. DOJO's website needs to make the distinction clearer: DOJO compounds over time because it builds a living graph of your brand history. Hightouch activates data. DOJO accumulates intelligence.\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"Use concrete outcome metrics in social proof. Percentages and timeframes build far more trust than logo walls alone.\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"The four-step execution narrative (insight to audience to creative to launch) is a useful structural model. DOJO should consider a similar narrative arc.\")\nadd_bullet(doc, \"Build a 'why we are different from CDPs' message. As Hightouch blurs the line, DOJO needs to clearly distinguish intelligence (understanding and compounding) from activation (syncing and deploying).\")\nadd_hr(doc)\n\nprint(\"Hightouch section done\")\n"}}

